<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 12.37 from 11.97 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 12.37 from 11.97 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month rose to 12.37 from 11.97 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) firmed to 11.80 from 11.35 percent.</p>
